{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年45歲的余文樂自今年7月宣布與台灣妻子王棠云離婚，結束9年婚姻後，除復出參與綜藝節目外，近日更趁空檔獨自飛往英國展開散心之旅。</p><p>移居當地多年的著名填詞人好友黃偉文（Wyman）隨即一盡地主之誼，連日來帶同樂仔四出遊歷，更深入英國郊區，遊覽</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:17:08.287290+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T10:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:31.012644+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:31.012644+00:00","content_hash":"1b123f8cfb63da2e3a8349574baa0208cf434500e9a88e6a6b6215d0609b7261","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}